  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can channel lunar magic when you assume a Wild Shape form, granting you the benefits below.</p><p><strong>Challenge Rating.</strong> The maximum Challenge Rating for the form equals your Druid level divided by 3 (round down, currently [[(floor(@classes.druid.levels / 3))]]).</p><p><strong>Armor Class.</strong> Until you leave the form, your AC equals 13 plus your Wisdom modifier if that total is higher than the Beast's AC.</p><p><strong>Temporary Hit Points.</strong> You gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to three times your Druid level.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-mYCNakmKwUlKSQaF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature can be used instead of Wild Shape and includes the expanded options and AC/Temporary Hit Point changes.</p></section>",
